│ show that BMI is the most important risk factor for hypertension following treatment of childhood cancer,            │
│ emphasising the need for CCS to maintain a normal weight."}, {"study_index": 109, "title": "Long‐term complications  │
│ in survivors of advanced stage neuroblastoma", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Few studies have assessed late effects in     │
│ neuroblastoma (NB) survivors, particularly those with advanced stage disease. METHODS Retrospective analysis of a    │
│ cohort of advanced stage NB survivors followed in a late effect clinic at a single institution. Screening tests to   │
