The numerous organ systems are subject to the late effects of anticancer therapy. The aim of this study was to          
investigate the blood pressure profile and ambulatory blood pressure monitoring, and also cardiac diastolic functions   
and pulmonary venous flow in 25 children with unilateral Wilms\' tumor in remission. METHODS The patient group consists 
of 25 patients who successfully completed anticancer treatment for unilateral Wilms\' tumor. Thirty-three age-, weight- 
