│ "title": "Toxicities of busulfan/melphalan versus carboplatin/etoposide/melphalan for high‐dose chemotherapy with    │
│ stem cell rescue for high‐risk neuroblastoma", "abstract": "The optimal autologous stem cell rescue (HDC-SCR)        │
