│ Ten (19%) patients were overweight and four (8%) were obese. According to DXA, 16/46 (35%) patients were obese.      │
│ Central obesity was found in 11 (21%) patients. Cranial irradiation, hypothalamic/hypophyseal damage, growth hormone │
│ (GH) deficiency and impaired mobility were associated with overweight/obesity and central obesity. Thirteen (25%)    │
