│ further studies including molecular markers are needed to augment therapy for the blastemal predominance subtype or  │
│ for favorable histology associated with loss of heterozygosity (LOA) at chromosomes 1p and 16q aiming at improved    │
│ survival. KEY WORDS Wilms\' tumor - Nephroblastoma."}, {"study_index": 470, "title": "Morbidity from abdominal       │
